            Triple("Health Technology Assessment (HTA) is a multidisciplinary process evaluating medical technologies (drugs, devices, procedures) regarding clinical effectiveness, safety, economic efficiency, and:", listOf("Manufacturer profit", "Ethical, social, and organizational impacts to inform policy decisions", "Sponsorship budget", "Packaging design"), 1),
            Triple("Public-Private Partnership (PPP) in health infrastructure involves long-term contract between government entity and private sector to design, finance, build, and operate healthcare facilities, aimed at:", listOf("Privatizing all public care", "Improving healthcare infrastructure quality and service access leveraging private efficiency", "Closing government hospitals", "Abolishing public health"), 1),
            Triple("Ecosystem of Health Disparity economics shows that living in low socioeconomic poverty areas increases exposure to environmental toxins, poor nutrition, and chronic stress, driving up:", listOf("High savings", "Disease burden, emergency room utilization, and catastrophic health spending", "Health literacy", "Life expectancy"), 1),
            Triple("Economic benefit of Investing in Nursing Education and Workforce expansion according to WHO yields a multi-fold return on investment (ROI) through improved population health, increased workforce productivity, and:", listOf("Higher unemployment", "Economic growth and gender empowerment", "Inflation", "Reduced hospital beds"), 1),
            Triple("Essential Medicines List (EML) published by WHO and adopted by Pakistan National Health Services prioritizes funding and availability for medications that satisfy the primary healthcare needs of the:", listOf("Rich elite population", "Majority of the population at prices the community can afford", "Private cosmetic clinics", "Export market"), 1),
            Triple("Generic Drug substitution policy mandates or encourages replacing brand-name pharmaceuticals with bioequivalent generic alternatives, achieving significant cost savings without compromising clinical:", listOf("Packaging color", "Efficacy, safety, and quality", "Tablet shape", "Brand popularity"), 1),
